From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] xilinx: skip null nets in source/sink discovery

Guard the route pre-pass against erased null net entries emitted by the
generated JSON.

--- a/xilinx/arch.cc
+++ b/xilinx/arch.cc
@@
     for (auto net : sorted(nets)) {
         NetInfo *ni = net.second;
+        if (ni == nullptr)
+            continue;
         for (auto &usr : ni->users) {
